      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FB Post Search\nBuilt a searching infra for posts, do not use any existing technology like Elasticsearch or PostGis Full-Text Search\n\n\n\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- Users should be able to create and like posts\n- Users should be able to search posts by keyword\n- Users should be able to get search results sorted by recency or like count\n\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Fast queries < 500ms\n- High Volume (TBD)\n- Eventual consistency, new posts visible in < 1min\n- All posts should be discoverable, including old and unpopular ones(we can take more time for this)\n- High Availability\n\n\n-------- Out of Scope ---------\n- Exact search, not fuzzy\n- No personalization\n- Simple ranking, no advanced \"relevance\"\n- No need to update realtime as new posts come in\n- No privacy rules",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FB Post Search\nBuilt a searching infra for posts, do not use any existing technology like Elasticsearch or PostGis Full-Text Search\n\n\n\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- Users should be able to create and like posts\n- Users should be able to search posts by keyword\n- Users should be able to get search results sorted by recency or like count\n\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Fast queries < 500ms\n- High Volume (TBD)\n- Eventual consistency, new posts visible in < 1min\n- All posts should be discoverable, including old and unpopular ones(we can take more time for this)\n- High Availability\n\n\n-------- Out of Scope ---------\n- Exact search, not fuzzy\n- No personalization\n- Simple ranking, no advanced \"relevance\"\n- No need to update realtime as new posts come in\n- No privacy rules",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
