      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784695417716,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scale Estimations\n- 1B users, 1 post per day avg, 10 likes per user per day, approx 100k seconds in a day\n    Posts created: 1B * 1 post/day / (100k seconds/day) = 10k posts/second\n    Likes created: 1B * 10 likes/day / (100k seconds/day) = 100k likes/second\n- Number of likes are significantly more than number of post creation\n- Searches: 1B * 1 search/day / (100k seconds/day) = 10k searches/second\n- Posts searchable: 1B posts/day * 365 days/year * 10 years = 3.6T posts\n  Raw size: 3.6T posts * 1kb/post = 3.6 PB",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scale Estimations\n- 1B users, 1 post per day avg, 10 likes per user per day, approx 100k seconds in a day\n    Posts created: 1B * 1 post/day / (100k seconds/day) = 10k posts/second\n    Likes created: 1B * 10 likes/day / (100k seconds/day) = 100k likes/second\n- Number of likes are significantly more than number of post creation\n- Searches: 1B * 1 search/day / (100k seconds/day) = 10k searches/second\n- Posts searchable: 1B posts/day * 365 days/year * 10 years = 3.6T posts\n  Raw size: 3.6T posts * 1kb/post = 3.6 PB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
