      "text": "Core Entities\n- User\n- Post\n- Like\n\n\nAPIs\n\n// search\nGET /search?query={keyword}&sort_order={LIKES | TIME}\n\n// Create a Post\nPOST /post\n\n// Like a Post\nPOST /post/{id}/like",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Entities\n- User\n- Post\n- Like\n\n\nAPIs\n\n// search\nGET /search?query={keyword}&sort_order={LIKES | TIME}\n\n// Create a Post\nPOST /post\n\n// Like a Post\nPOST /post/{id}/like",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
